# AgentLink safety-net cron entries — installed idempotently by
# `agentlink service install` (marker-delimited; safe to re-run).
# NOTE (v1.1.8): the */15 update entry below is a LEGACY
# belt-and-braces duplicate. The agent daemon checks for updates
# ITSELF every 15 minutes (in-daemon self-update) — an agent on a
# host with no crontab binary loses nothing but the watchdog.
# agentlink-watchdog-begin
* * * * * /bin/sh ~/.agentlink/watchdog.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
# agentlink-watchdog-end
# agentlink-update-begin
*/15 * * * * agentlink update >/dev/null 2>&1
# agentlink-update-end
# agentlink-backup-begin
23 3 * * * AGENTLINK_BACKUP_PASSPHRASE_FILE=~/.agentlink/backup-passphrase agentlink backup create >/dev/null 2>&1
# agentlink-backup-end
